Creeping dark slowly spreads from the target location and [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] spots in a radius of 3 around the targeted location. The dark deals [35, 47, 56, 64, 71 (TL1-5; MP 100)] darkness damage each turn to anything in its area, and blocks the sight of any who do not possess Dark Vision or some other magical means of seeing. The darkness seeps into adjacent tiles at random and slowly dissipates over time.

The damage will increase with your Mindpower. You do [+5%, +9%, +12%, +15%, +17% (TL1-5)] damage to anything that has entered your creeping dark.
